{"id":"n27303-1-6","stage":2,"title":"거북이 · 龟","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27303-1-6-1","ko":"집에서 어떤 동물을 키우니?","zh":"你在家里养什么动物啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동물을","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키우니?","meaning":"养","explanation":"키우다：养；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"2","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"在生物界的两条分支中，从食物中获取营养，并可以自由活动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]},{"id":"cff5458b4f7fee67","term":"키우다","zh":"养","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3","entryId":"66587","definition":"照料动植物而使其成长。","pronunciation":["키우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bef743f28ab79343cb22.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27303-1-6-2","ko":"나는 거북이를 좋아해서 여러 마리의 거북이를 키우고 있어.","zh":"我喜欢龟，所以养了好几只龟。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거북이를","meaning":"龟，乌龟","explanation":"거북이：龟，乌龟；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거북이","audio":"/audio/12f9eaa937895bbde586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27303","senseId":"1","lemma":"거북이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아해서","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여러","meaning":"多个，许多，多种","explanation":"여러：多个，许多，多种","readings":[{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17300","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마리의","meaning":"只，头，条","explanation":"마리：只，头，条；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"마리","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51771","senseId":"1","lemma":"마리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거북이를","meaning":"龟，乌龟","explanation":"거북이：龟，乌龟；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거북이","audio":"/audio/12f9eaa937895bbde586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27303","senseId":"1","lemma":"거북이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키우고","meaning":"养","explanation":"키우다：养；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"2","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"12f9eaa937895bbd","term":"거북이","zh":"龟，乌龟","audio":"/audio/12f9eaa937895bbde586.mp3","entryId":"27303","definition":"一种身体呈扁椭圆状的动物，脖子短，有坚硬的背壳，可以把头、尾和四肢蜷缩在里面。","pronunciation":["거부기"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"9132eb626207a0b0","term":"여러","zh":"多个，许多，多种","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3","entryId":"17300","definition":"很多数量的。","pronunciation":["여러"]},{"id":"1338676ef4cf144f","term":"마리","zh":"只，头，条","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3","entryId":"51771","definition":"计算飞禽走兽或鱼虫等的数量单位。","pronunciation":["마리"]},{"id":"cff5458b4f7fee67","term":"키우다","zh":"养","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3","entryId":"66587","definition":"照料动植物而使其成长。","pronunciation":["키우다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/65ab44351b03835824a2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.29,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27303","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我喜欢龟，所以养了好几只龟。","我打算去15层。","你在家里养什么动物啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我喜欢龟，所以养了好几只龟。","你在家里养什么动物啊？","我打算去15层。"],"answer":0}]}
